info: { title: Orders API, version: 1.0.0 }
paths:
  /orders:
    post: { operationId: createOrder }
  /orders/{id}:
    get: { operationId: getOrder }
  /orders/{id}/ship:
    post: { operationId: shipOrder }
```

## main.aro
```aro
(Application-Start: Orders API) {
    Log "Starting Orders API..." to the <console>.
    Start the <http-server> with <contract>.
    Keepalive the <application> for the <events>.
    Return an <OK: status> for the <startup>.
}

(createOrder: Orders API) {
    Extract the <data> from the <request: body>.
    Create the <order> with <data>.
    Store the <order> into the <order-repository>.
    Emit an <OrderCreated: event> with <order>.
    Return a <Created: status> with <order>.
}

(getOrder: Orders API) {
    Extract the <id> from the <pathParameters: id>.
    Retrieve the <order> from the <order-repository> where <id> is <id>.
    Return a <NotFound: status> with <id> when <order> is nil.
    Return an <OK: status> with <order>.
}

(shipOrder: Orders API) {
    Extract the <id> from the <pathParameters: id>.
    Retrieve the <order> from the <order-repository> where <id> is <id>.
    Emit an <OrderShipped: event> with <order>.
    Return an <OK: status> with <order>.
}

(Audit Orders: order-repository Observer) {
    Extract the <change> from the <event: changeType>.
    Log <change> to the <console>.
    Return an <OK: status> for the <audit>.
}
```
